        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"logan_mann\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/43a26b/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> logan_mann:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>TheJayMann wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Well, that settles that.&nbsp; My next game will be Unity, Visionary, and Legacy. &nbsp;(Well, I'll try anyway.)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;You need to fight Matriarch...i believe she is also a teenager according to the website info page on her.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Too bad we don't have a mall- or school-themed environment.</p>",
