        "id": 43952,
        "name": "beevolant",
        "username": "beevolant",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-13T22:18:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That sounds totally likely. I think the reason why you see some people knowing stuff about characters that seems to have no source is either from podcasts (Christopher has done a bunch to promote the game and almost always throws us fans a bone with some new information) or from when folks have met them at cons or when Christopher does one of his game shop tours (isn't he in Indiana right now?).&nbsp;</p><p>I like the idea of a team expansion - X-men style - where instead of the usual formula (2 heroes, 4 villains, 2 environments) we get something like 4 heroes, 2 villains, 2 environments. But I just really like having more choices in heroes, and honestly, more villains makes the game more replayable...</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
